sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Envoy as Envoy Gateway Proxy<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant IPP as IPP ExternalProcessor<br/>9004/TCP gRPC
    participant Plugins as Plugin Pipeline<br/>(PreProc → Profile → PostProc)
    participant DataLayer as Data Layer<br/>(EventNotifier → Extractors)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ConfigMap as ConfigMaps<br/>(model mappings)
    participant Pool as InferencePool<br/>(via HTTPRoute)
    participant EPP as llm-d Router EPP<br/>(Pod Selection)
    participant ModelServer as Model Server Pod

    Note over IPP,K8sAPI: Startup: ConfigMap Watch Established
    IPP->>K8sAPI: Watch ConfigMaps<br/>ServiceAccount Token
    K8sAPI-->>IPP: ConfigMap Data<br/>(LoRA → base model mappings)

    Note over Client,ModelServer: Flow 1: Inference Request Processing (Multi-Pool Routing)

    Client->>Envoy: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>{"model": "lora-adapter-1", ...}<br/>TLS 1.2+
    Envoy->>IPP: ext-proc RequestHeaders<br/>gRPC (Optional TLS)
    IPP->>Plugins: PreProcessors → ProfilePicker

    Envoy->>IPP: ext-proc RequestBody<br/>gRPC stream
    IPP->>Plugins: body-field-to-header:<br/>Extract "model" → X-Gateway-Model-Name
    IPP->>Plugins: base-model-extractor:<br/>Lookup "lora-adapter-1" in ConfigMap
    IPP->>Plugins: base-model-to-header:<br/>Inject X-Gateway-Base-Model-Name

    Note over IPP,DataLayer: Flow 2: Data Layer Event Processing
    IPP->>DataLayer: Fire request event<br/>(non-blocking, buffered channel)
    DataLayer->>DataLayer: Extractors process:<br/>request-metadata, cost-metadata
    DataLayer->>DataLayer: Update in-memory Datastore

    IPP-->>Envoy: HeaderMutation:<br/>+X-Gateway-Model-Name: lora-adapter-1<br/>+X-Gateway-Base-Model-Name: base-model-1

    Note over Envoy,Pool: HTTPRoute header match selects pool
    Envoy->>Pool: Route to InferencePool<br/>(matches X-Gateway-Base-Model-Name)
    Pool->>EPP: EPP selects pod within pool
    EPP->>ModelServer: Forward to selected pod<br/>8000/TCP HTTP

    ModelServer-->>EPP: Inference Response
    EPP-->>Pool: Response
    Pool-->>Envoy: Response

    Envoy->>IPP: ext-proc ResponseHeaders
    IPP->>Plugins: Profile Response Plugins
    Envoy->>IPP: ext-proc ResponseBody
    IPP->>Plugins: PostProcessors

    IPP->>DataLayer: Fire response event<br/>(non-blocking)
    DataLayer->>DataLayer: cost-metadata extractor:<br/>Update cost estimates

    IPP-->>Envoy: Response mutations<br/>(if any)
    Envoy-->>Client: Final Response<br/>TLS 1.2+
